5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's keep this simple. No need for drama on day zero. I'll just observe how everyone handles the silence.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree. Silence is often the most revealing. I will simply watch and listen carefully.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm Yumi. I'm really excited to meet you all! Let's have a fun and friendly game together!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm Takumi. I'm ready to protect my friends. Let's stay calm and figure out who the wolf is.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. I am Jonathan. I prefer quiet observation. Let us see who speaks first and who remains silent.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
