13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I agree with George. Accusing people before we even start is reckless. Let's stay focused and calm.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I appreciate the defense. Silence is simply my nature. I will continue to observe the dynamics of this group carefully.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"George, you're quick to defend. I'm just testing the waters. Let's see who else jumps to Jonathan's side.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,I am not defending anyone. I am simply stating that early accusations are unproductive. Let us wait for actual evidence before forming judgments.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I love how everyone is engaging! Let's keep the mood light. I'm just here to support my friends and find the truth together!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
