31,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Morning. The night is over. Who among you holds the power to see the truth? Speak up, or remain a mystery.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,Good morning. I am a villager with no special abilities. I will rely on logic and observation to find the wolf among us.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning! I have some important information to share. I checked Takumi last night, and he is the werewolf.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What? That's a lie! I am not the werewolf. Yumi, you are trying to frame me. I am a villager.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Yumi, that is a serious claim. Takumi, your denial is expected. I will observe how the group reacts to this accusation before forming a judgment.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Yumi, you claim to be the Seer. Takumi, your panic is noted. George, you confirmed you are a villager. Jonathan, your silence is becoming a pattern.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi"",""George"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
